Now add `captureAuthorizedPaymentInSandbox` and `releaseAuthorizedPaymentInSandbox` functions (sandbox: craft signed provider callbacks) plus reuse-safe internal helper. Where: payments/service.ts bottom. Also they need the mock provider instance for signing.

```ts
/** Sandbox helper: provider-side events for a hold (capture/release), HMAC signed. */
async function providerHoldEvent(signer: MockPaymentProvider, payment: Payment, status: "PAID" | "CANCELLED") {
  const rawBody = JSON.stringify({
    providerPaymentId: payment.providerPaymentId,
    amount: Number(payment.amount),
    currency: payment.currency,
    status,
    eventId: `mock_evt_${randomUUID()}`,
  });
